   },
   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "10b99a",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "title": "Donate",
      "header_size": "h2",
      "_element_id": "donate"
     },
     "elements": [],
     "widgetType": "heading"
    },
    {
     "id": "10d889",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>If you feel FaHa has served you, a family member, friend, or community you care about and would like to support our mission please donate through the campaign below.</p>\n"
     },
     "elements": [],
     "widgetType": "text-editor"
    },
    {
     "id": "10f778",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "shortcode": "[faha_embed url=\"https://www.zeffy.com/embed/donation-form/ongoing-support-2\" label=\"Open the donation form\"]"
     },
     "elements": [],
     "widgetType": "shortcode"
    },
    {
     "id": "111667",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "title": "Employer matching",
      "header_size": "h2",
      "_element_id": "employer-matching"
     },
     "elements": [],
     "widgetType": "heading"
    },
    {
     "id": "113556",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>Check to see if your company is one of the many that offer charitable donation matching: <a href=\"https://www.charitynavigator.org/donor-basics/giving-101/employee-match-programs/?bay=content.view&amp;cpid=1799\" rel=\"noopener\">Charity match programs (Charity Navigator)</a>.</p>\n"
     },
     "elements": [],
     "widgetType": "text-editor"
    },
    {
     "id": "115445",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "title": "Where the money goes",
      "header_size": "h2",
      "_element_id": "where-the-money-goes"
     },
     "elements": [],
     "widgetType": "heading"
    },
    {
     "id": "117334",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<div class=\"grid paths\"><article class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"/support/funding-request/\">Funding requests</a></h3><p>Any member in good standing may request funding for an activity that furthers the education and community of our members.</p>\n</article><article class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"/support/funding-request/\">Micro-scholarships</a></h3><p class=\"is-placeholder\">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Nulla quis lorem ut libero malesuada feugiat.</p>\n</article><article class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"/faq/\">Board-planned events</a></h3><p>Potlucks, chess tournaments, dances or festivals, planned by the board with group donations.</p>\n</article></div>\n"
     },
     "elements": [],
     "widgetType": "html"
    },
    {
     "id": "119223",
     "elType": "widget",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>FaHa is a 501(c)(3) charity. All funds go towards furthering the mission of the group.</p>\n"
     },
     "elements": [],
     "widgetType": "text-editor"
    }
